    "sinoVietnameseComparison": "Vietnam ranks among Southeast Asia's fastest-growing digital economies, selectively adapting and localizing high-efficiency Chinese operational models while avoiding private platform monopolies. For example, Vietnam's nationwide VietQR interbank QR payment leapfrogged into cashless adoption across wet markets and cafés much like WeChat Pay and Alipay, yet was built atop an open, interoperable NAPAS public switching infrastructure. Likewise, livestream commerce on TikTok Shop and Shopee directly draws on Hangzhou and Guangzhou content-and-fulfillment playbooks, alongside VinFast's regional push into electric urban mobility.",
