      "Vietnam comprises five complementary commercial sub-cultures: Hanoi (institutional policy), Hải Phòng–Quảng Ninh (industrial seaports), Bắc Ninh–Bắc Giang (FDI electronics assembly), Đà Nẵng–Central Coast (services and emerging tech), and Ho Chi Minh City–Southeast (commercial market dynamism and startups).",
      "Fourteen actionable strategic lessons for Vietnam center on upgrading domestic supporting industries, building enterprise–university R&D clusters, and escaping the low-value-added contract assembly trap."
