        "hanViet": "Mỗi phùng giai tiết bội tư thân.",
        "translationEn": "Whenever a festive reunion day comes round, one misses family back home twice as much (the quintessential East Asian ethos behind 'Chunyun' and homecoming).",
        "source": "Wang Wei, 'Thinking of My Brothers in Shandong on the Ninth Day of the Ninth Month' (8th century)"
