        "body": "Tracking data in Figure FIG-09 indicates exponential growth in CBEC transaction volumes moving from bonded warehouses in Guangxi, Guangdong, and Zhejiang into Vietnam. Parcel delivery lead times from Shenzhen and Dongguan to Hanoi via the Pingxiang–Friendship Pass bonded logistics hubs have compressed to just 48–72 hours."
