        "source": "Layer 1 · Great Image Commentary: Book of Changes, Hexagrams Qian & Kun (Zhouyi · Daxiang Zhuan / 周易·大象传) — The two most celebrated lines of the Yijing, adopted in the early twentieth century as the official motto of Tsinghua University in Beijing."
